<title>GERMANY: PAN-GERMAN OCT ADJUSTED UNEMPLOYMENT RISES.</title>
<headline>PAN-GERMAN OCT ADJUSTED UNEMPLOYMENT RISES.</headline>
<text>
<p>NUREMBERG, Germany, Nov 7 Reuter) - The Federal Labour</p>
<p>Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> PAN-GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT   Oct 96	Sept 96	  Oct 95</p>
<p> Number (unadj)		3.866 mln   3.848 mln	3.526 mln</p>
<p> Number (adj)		  4.040 mln   3.999 mln	3.663 mln</p>
<p> Change in adj number     +41,000     +39,000	   n/a</p>
<p> Rate (unadj)		  10.1 pct    10.1 pct	 9.2 pct</p>
<p> Short-time workers	  231,319     201,186	  179,446</p>
<p> Vacancies (unadj)	   293,656     318,042	  289,347</p>
<p> Change in numbers in work Aug 96	Jul 96</p>
<p>				  -55,000	+5,000 (+9,000)</p>
<p> W.GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT   Oct 96	 Sept 96	   Oct 95</p>
<p> Number (unadj)	    2.769 mln     2.748 mln	2.492 mln</p>
<p> Number (adj)		2.886 mln     2.856 mln	2.595 mln</p>
<p> Change (adj)	     +30,000	 +37,000	   n/a</p>
<p> Rate (unadj)		9.0 pct	 8.9 pct	  7.9 pct</p>
<p> Short-time workers	182,573	 152,613	  121,568</p>
<p> Vacancies		   235,105	 259,211	  231,186</p>
<p> Change in number in wrk Aug 96	  Jul 96</p>
<p>				 -58,000	 -5,000 (UNCH)</p>
<p> E.GERMAN UNEMPLOYMENT   Oct 96	 Sept 96	  Oct 95</p>
<p> Number (unadj)	    1.097 mln    1.099 mln	1.034 mln</p>
<p> Number (adj)		1.154 mln    1.143 mln	1.076 mln</p>
<p> Change (adj)		+11,000	+6,000) (+4,000) n/a</p>
<p> Rate (unadj)		14.7 pct     14.7 pct	 13.0 pct</p>
<p> Short-time workers	48,746	 48,573	   57,878</p>
<p> Vacancies		   58,551	 58,831	   58,161</p>
<p> Change in number in wrk Aug 96	 Jul 96</p>
<p>				+3,000	 +10,000 (+9,000)</p>
